( mcap1_elast - elastic A/B twin of mcap1 (Sprint 10 lote 7): the SAME
  isotropic compression rig (hex8, v = -0.04, dt 0.05, 40 load steps +
  5 unload steps) WITHOUT the cap1 record. Elastic: p = K*deps_vol*40 =
  833.3*0.006*40 = 200 at the end of loading, drops 25 during unloading
  -> p = 175 -> sigxx = -175 (isotropic). The cap1 twin ends at
  sigxx = -85.6 (cap limits p at pc ~ 111): the A/B discriminates the
  surface. )

